# This repo is developed on Windows and built on macOS, and the Windows
# clone has core.autocrlf=true. Without this file that setting rewrites Go
# sources to CRLF on checkout, and `gofmt -l` then reports every one of
# them as unformatted — which trains you to ignore gofmt output, right up
# until it is reporting something real.
#
# Go, shell scripts and plists are LF everywhere, in the working tree as
# well as in the object store.
*.go   text eol=lf
*.mod  text eol=lf
*.sum  text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.plist text eol=lf
*.m    text eol=lf
*.h    text eol=lf
*.c    text eol=lf

# Generated icon art and snapshots are binary; never touch them.
*.png  binary
*.icns binary
